WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
This is the Underwriting Intelligence Lab:
two fully synthetic cases,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
built to show evidence-to-decision work—not
investment advice or autonomous judgment.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.500
AtlasGrid begins where an investment committee begins:
the question, the current REPRICE posture,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
the proposed $210 million cap,
and five unresolved gates.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.500
The seller’s $240 million ask misses
the declared return hurdle.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Changing the entry assumption loads
a complete deterministic case;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
at $210 million,
gross IRR reaches 23.3 percent,

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.000
but quantitative clearance
does not grant approval.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Open any important number to see its meaning, formula,
operands, and retained synthetic source.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The partner packet carries the same recommendation,
downside, decision conditions, and ownership plan

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
into an exportable committee artifact,
with a separate technical appendix.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Helios applies the same discipline
to venture financing.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Point returns are attractive,
yet the current call remains HOLD

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
because the synthetic prior produces a 20 percent
loss frequency, above the analyst-set 10 percent maximum.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Assumptions and policy thresholds are editable
in a working scenario, visibly classified,

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
and never changed by a model.
Alter growth or the loss ceiling;

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.000
retained deterministic cases update
transaction outputs and returns,

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.000
while the decision record preserves
each change and its bound result.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.000
The result is not an AI answer.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.500
It is a reviewable underwriting system:
evidence, economics, downside,

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.000
judgment, and action—with synthetic limitations
stated throughout.
